    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 09:33:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hi hi，大家好呀~这是一份来自七月上旬的毕业回忆录，后来因为一些事情耽搁了，就到了这个时候才制作完成，好久不见哇。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这份回忆录围绕顾望的毕业季经历展开，大致分为毕业旅行及毕业照拍摄这两条主线。如果能让你们收获点什么那就最好了，没有的话，也希望你们能听得享受、听得舒服开心。那么，请跟我一同进入回忆里吧。（文末含旅途等照片，配合食用效果更佳哦~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 毕业旅行之平潭篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 毕业旅行之东山岛篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 毕业旅行之厦门篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">49:36</a> 毕业照拍摄经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a>天台奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a> 我的那位上进且人很好的好朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 许愿（我来还愿啦，我是一只看过易烊千玺演唱会的肥鹤啦，非常幸运，非常幸福！希望希望还能再看！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a> 顾望的毕业独白①</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> 余舒的毕业独白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3019">50:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3161">52:41</a> 顾望的毕业独白②</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大的车票——一米三</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邀请大家共赏顾望的旅途照片及毕业独白文字版</span></p><span></span><p><span>平潭篇）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpTCRoKDieNJ13cjjPWglX5ONt-c.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkhcHPe6rph7HETKxjMAH4sfF9lb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loOamZYP5DFL8x6j6gBHhO40IgoK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhvjGJtuS9UcPajfpCZj9Hhf_1AA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FikVPkP2xYOHJ8TEyj2SeaCMK9uF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>东山岛篇）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lotOI8BBLZTRPiG47iM1tL90CNkJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnNgOnBLdP0MBaAsQdK4E4riUdF0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lruuu7N3hPVBY6tt6N4WxApTBkr3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvip1XVa-utKAU164HKaROnXa1H3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm8pl8CnhFZHAUW4XrQYGnnfoEh7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfnQV89fBrBKvboUQcigs9xjxeE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>厦门篇）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhRGdGwh7sDN--dCCiAWw4G6HFJF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>毕业独白文字版）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOnYIcQvwQeLIUV7dwT26dUhmEs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhOsrfC-EYeqGafrmymEUHEIJ8Kf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、网易云、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、荔枝、QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
