    <guid isPermaLink="false">668666870bc5d7cc70cb94c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 09:08:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我俩~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 我俩的友谊历程——“打从有意识开始，我们就是好朋友~"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 跟随顾望的记忆，去回顾我俩的友情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 会不会担心以后会分开？我能跟你永远做好朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> 会不会伤心？我的好朋友 还有TA自己的好朋友 。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 我眼中的你，是一个怎样的存在？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 或许，阶段性的友谊也很美好~（同样是一份珍贵的礼物！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起老去——薛凯琪/陈意涵/杨子姗</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏至未至 钢琴版——大宇小星</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>高考后的聊天记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYxmwIntslR-hxAvUSbtzSOa5dR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>看完问题后的余舒，给顾望发的消息</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjeEuAUeojc8ParWlnOSLpozU774.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【其他信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客平台：小宇宙、网易云、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、荔枝</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：see_sea2023@163.com（听众投稿/来信、合作洽谈）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgD-LNfaXyCP0e_OYtp3EAVS2JuX.m4a" length="41944672" type="audio/mp4"/>
